A.bsM=new B.fK("Nombor talian penting polis / bomba","\ud83d\ude92 Bomba & Penyelamat: 994\n\ud83d\ude91 Ambulans: 999\n\ud83d\udc6e Polis: 999\n\ud83c\udf0a JPS (Jabatan Pengairan): 1-800-88-2737\n\ud83c\udfe5 Hospital Klang: 03-3375 6699\n\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Bilik Gerakan Daerah Klang: 03-3371 XXXX\n\ud83d\udcf1 Koordinator: 03-XXXX XXXX\n\ud83d\udce9 SMS (Tanpa Internet): 15888","Key emergency numbers","\ud83d\ude92 Fire & Rescue: 994\n\ud83d\ude91 Ambulance: 999\n\ud83d\udc6e Police: 999\n\ud83c\udf0a JPS (Irrigation Dept): 1-800-88-2737\n\ud83c\udfe5 Klang Hospital: 03-3375 6699\n\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Klang District Command Center: 03-3371 XXXX\n\ud83d\udcf1 Coordinator Hotline: 03-XXXX XXXX\n\ud83d\udce9 SMS (No Internet): 15888")
A.aK7=s([A.bsM],t.vU)
A.bsW=new B.pm(A.km,A.N,"Kecemasan Talian","Emergency Hotlines",A.aK7)
A.bsO=new B.fK("Peralatan wajib sebelum ke lapangan","\u2022 Jaket keselamatan (MANDATORI)\n\u2022 Kasut getah / bot bertutup\n\u2022 Lampu suluh kalis air\n\u2022 Pelindung kepala (keledar)\n\u2022 Kit pertolongan cemas\n\u2022 Radio walkie-talkie\n\u2022 Air dan makanan tenaga untuk 4 jam","Mandatory field equipment","\u2022 Life jacket (MANDATORY)\n\u2022 Covered rubber boots / shoes\n\u2022 Waterproof flashlight\n\u2022 Head protection (helmet)\n\u2022 Personal first aid kit\n\u2022 Radio / walkie-talkie\n\u2022 Water and energy food for 4 hours")
A.bsQ=new B.fK("Had keselamatan air","\ud83d\udeab JANGAN redah air bergerak melebihi paras lutut.\n\ud83d\udeab JANGAN masuk kawasan tanpa ketua kumpulan.\n\u2705 Sentiasa bergerak dalam kumpulan minimum 2 orang.\n\u2705 Hubungi koordinator setiap 30 minit.\n\u2705 Gunakan tali keselamatan di air deras.","Water safety limits","\ud83d\udeab DO NOT cross moving water above knee height.\n\ud83d\udeab DO NOT enter areas without a team leader.\n\u2705 Always move in groups of minimum 2 people.\n\u2705 Contact coordinator every 30 mins.\n\u2705 Use safety ropes in rapid waters.")
A.bsN=new B.fK("Tindakan jika ahli pasukan tercedera?","1. Hubungi 999 segera.\n2. Lakukan pertolongan cemas jika terlatih.\n3. JANGAN menggerakkan mangsa jika disyaki kecederaan tulang belakang.\n4. Kemas kini status GPS di dalam aplikasi.\n5. Rekod insiden bagi tujuan Laporan Keselamatan.","What to do if a team member is injured?","1. Call 999 immediately for medical emergencies.\n2. Apply basic first aid if trained.\n3. Do NOT move the victim if spinal injury is suspected.\n4. Update coordinator via app and mark your GPS location.\n5. Document the incident for the Safety Report.")
A.aZ4=s([A.bsO,A.bsQ,A.bsN],t.vU)
A.bsX=new B.pm(A.u8,A.ao,"Keselamatan Lapangan","Field Safety",A.aZ4)
A.bsS=new B.fK("Apa yang perlu saya lakukan apabila menerima tawaran misi?",'1. Buka tab SOS / Dispatch dan semak lokasi mangsa pada peta.\n2. Tekan "Terima & Pergi" untuk mengunci misi.\n3. Hubungi koordinator anda di talian 03-XXXX XXXX sebelum bergerak.\n4. Rekod masa bertolak dan ETA anda.\n5. Hubungi 999 jika kawasan tidak selamat.',"What should I do upon receiving a mission offer?",'1. Open the SOS / Dispatch tab and check the victim location on the map.\n2. Press "Accept & Go" to lock the mission.\n3. Call your coordinator at 03-XXXX XXXX before moving.\n4. Record your departure time and ETA.\n5. Call 999 if the area is unsafe.')
A.bsL=new B.fK("Bagaimana jika saya tidak dapat tiba di lokasi mangsa?","Lapor kepada koordinator segera melalui aplikasi atau hubungi 03-XXXX XXXX. JANGAN cuba redah air deras setinggi lutut. Dokumentasikan koordinat GPS dan hantar kepada pasukan sokongan.","What if I cannot reach the victim location?","Report to your coordinator immediately via the app or call 03-XXXX XXXX. Do NOT attempt to cross floodwater deeper than knee height. Document the GPS coordinates and pass them to the next available team.")
A.bsP=new B.fK("Bagaimana cara saya menanda misi selesai?",'Pada skrin "Misi Aktif", tatal ke bawah dan tekan butang hijau "MISI SELESAI". Sediakan bukti (gambar/video ringkas) sebelum menanda selesai. Senarai misi anda akan dikemas kini secara automatik.',"How do I mark a mission as completed?",'On the "Active Mission" screen, scroll down and press the green "MISSION COMPLETED" button. Provide proof (brief photo/video) before marking it complete. Your mission list will update automatically.')
A.b1b=s([A.bsS,A.bsL,A.bsP],t.vU)
A.bsY=new B.pm(A.dL,A.R,"Prosedur Gerak Balas","Response Procedure",A.b1b)
A.bsR=new B.fK("Bagaimana mendapatkan Sijil Perkhidmatan?",'Sijil Perkhidmatan Sukarelawan dijana secara automatik selepas 3 misi selesai. Tekan "Sijil Perkhidmatan" di Laman Utama untuk memuat turun PDF. Nama pada sijil berdasarkan profil yang anda daftarkan.',"How to obtain the Service Certificate?",'Volunteer Service Certificates are auto-generated after 3 completed missions. Press "Service Certificate" on Home to download the PDF. The name is based on your registered profile.')
A.bsV=new B.fK("Adakah saya mendapat elaun semasa bertugas?","Sukarelawan RELA dan Swasta menerima:\n\u2022 Elaun harian: RM 30/hari (untuk misi > 8 jam)\n\u2022 Insurans kemalangan: RM 50,000\n\u2022 Makan dan minum disediakan di PPS.","Do I get an allowance during duty?","Private & RELA volunteers receive:\n\u2022 Daily allowance: RM 30/day (for duty > 8 hours)\n\u2022 Accident insurance limit: RM 50,000\n\u2022 Food and drinks are provided at the evacuation center.")
A.bsK=new B.fK("Bagaimana menukar kenderaan/kemahiran di profil?",'Pergi ke tab Misi \u2192 tekan butang "Edit Profil" (butang hijau). Kemas kini kemahiran dan kenderaan anda, kemudian tekan SIMPAN.',"How do I update my skills / vehicle after registering?",'Go to the Missions tab \u2192 tap the "Edit Profile" button (green FAB). Update your skills and vehicle, then tap SAVE. Changes reflect instantly.')
A.aXl=s([A.bsR,A.bsV,A.bsK],t.vU)
A.bsZ=new B.pm(A.ho,A.hc,"Pentadbiran","Administration",A.aXl)
A.a7q=new B.a6(61659,"MaterialIcons",!1)
A.bsU=new B.fK("Saluran komunikasi rasmi","Radio: Kanal 1 (umum) / Kanal 3 (kecemasan)\nWhatsApp Kumpulan: Hubungi penyelaras anda untuk dijemput\nTalian Koordinator: 03-XXXX XXXX (24/7)\nApp FloodSense: Tab Misi untuk kemas kini masa nyata","Official communication channels","Radio: Channel 1 (general) / Channel 3 (emergency)\nWhatsApp Group: Ask your coordinator to invite you\nCoordinator Hotline: 03-XXXX XXXX (24/7)\nFloodSense App: Mission tab for real-time updates")
A.bsT=new B.fK("Apa peranan ketua kumpulan (Team Leader)?","Ketua kumpulan bertanggungjawab untuk:\n\u2022 Mengarahkan laluan dan keputusan di lapangan\n\u2022 Melaporkan status setiap 30 minit\n\u2022 Mengesahkan keselamatan ahli sebelum berundur\n\u2022 Mengisi Laporan Insiden selepas setiap misi","What is the role of the Team Leader?","The team leader is responsible for:\n\u2022 Directing routes and field decisions\n\u2022 Reporting status to coordinator every 30 mins\n\u2022 Confirming safety of all members before withdrawing\n\u2022 Filling out the Incident Report post-mission")
A.bsJ=new B.fK("Bagaimana membuat laporan terus pada JPBD?",'1. Guna butang "Laporan Kecemasan" di Laman Utama.\n2. Masukkan jenis insiden, lokasi, dan bilangan mangsa.\n3. Laporan akan dihantar terus ke Jawatankuasa Pengurusan Bencana Daerah (JPBD).\n4. Masa maklum balas < 30 minit bagi kes KRITIKAL.',"How do I escalate to government authorities?",'1. Use the "Emergency Report" button on the Home screen.\n2. Fill in the incident type, location, and number of victims.\n3. The report is sent directly to the District Disaster Management Committee (JPBD).\n4. Expected response time: < 30 minutes for CRITICAL incidents.')
A.aXf=s([A.bsU,A.bsT,A.bsJ],t.vU)
A.bt_=new B.pm(A.a7q,A.I,"Koordinasi Pasukan","Team Coordination",A.aXf)
